// What ps-qa has to be told about the harness.
//
// Deliberately almost empty, and that is the point. AgencyZero's profile
// carries surfaces, collapsible sections, destructive-control exclusions and
// navigation entry points, because the harness has to find its way around a
// whole application before it can touch a control. Here there is one component
// on the page and nothing else, so there is nothing to navigate, nothing to
// collapse, and nothing that must not be pressed.
//
// Everything below exists to say "there is one surface and it is already open".
AppProfile(
    // One surface: the page itself. `marker` is the harness title, which the
    // page always renders, so arrival is decidable without knowing which
    // component is mounted.
    surfaces: [
        (name: "harness", opener: "\u{0}dynamic-document", marker: Some("QA")),
    ],

    permanent_surfaces: [],
    navigation_controls: [],
    sections: [],
)
